{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0189ypVwPgudk7cvWkZyEwLG","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"exp-014: Naturalistic CC Validation\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"对 Common Crawl 2025-09 和 2026-01 两个 snapshot 各采样 5K 文档， 用训练好的 15D OBD classifier 做 depth prediction， 与 AlignScore (factual consistency) 和 type-token ratio (vocabulary richness) 做 correlation。 验证 K* boundary 在 wild data 上的生态效度。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"n_docs_per_snapshot\": 5000,\n7\t      \"total_docs\": 10000,\n8\t      \"depth_distribution_cc2025_09\": {\n9\t        \"depth_0\": 0.645,\n10\t        \"depth_1\": 0.218,\n11\t        \"depth_2\": 0.094,\n12\t        \"depth_3\": 0.032,\n13\t        \"depth_4_plus\": 0.011\n14\t      },\n15\t      \"depth_distribution_cc2026_01\": {\n16\t        \"depth_0\": 0.598,\n17\t        \"depth_1\": 0.241,\n18\t        \"depth_2\": 0.112,\n19\t        \"depth_3\": 0.037,\n20\t        \"depth_4_plus\": 0.012\n21\t      },\n22\t      \"synthetic_proportion_increase_2025_to_2026\": \"+4.7pp\",\n23\t      \"correlation_depth_vs_alignscore\": {\n24\t        \"spearman_rho\": -0.312,\n25\t        \"p_value\": \"<0.001\",\n26\t        \"direction\": \"deeper predicted depth → lower factual consistency\"\n27\t      },\n28\t      \"correlation_depth_vs_ttr\": {\n29\t        \"spearman_rho\": -0.274,\n30\t        \"p_value\": \"<0.001\",\n31\t        \"direction\": \"deeper predicted depth → lower vocabulary richness\"\n32\t      },\n33\t      \"correlation_depth_vs_perplexity_ref\": {\n34\t        \"spearman_rho\": -0.198,\n35\t        \"p_value\": \"<0.001\",\n36\t        \"direction\": \"deeper predicted depth → lower reference perplexity (more predictable/generic)\"\n37\t      },\n38\t      \"binary_0v1_precision_estimated\": 0.82,\n39\t      \"binary_0v1_recall_estimated\": 0.78,\n40\t      \"depth_2plus_collapse_rate\": 0.73,\n41\t      \"key_finding\": \"Predicted depth 0 vs 1 separation is ecologically valid (correlates with independent quality proxies). Depth ≥2 predictions collapse (consistent with K*=2 one-wash boundary). 2026-01 shows higher synthetic proportion than 2025-09, consistent with accelerating recursive contamination.\\n\"\n42\t    },\n43\t    \"tables\": [\n44\t      {\n45\t        \"name\": \"Table: Predicted Depth Distribution on Common Crawl Snapshots\",\n46\t        \"content\": \"| Predicted Depth | CC 2025-09 | CC 2026-01 | Δ |\\n|----------------|-----------|-----------|-------|\\n| 0 (human) | 64.5% | 59.8% | -4.7pp |\\n| 1 | 21.8% | 24.1% | +2.3pp |\\n| 2 | 9.4% | 11.2% | +1.8pp |\\n| 3 | 3.2% | 3.7% | +0.5pp |\\n| 4+ | 1.1% | 1.2% | +0.1pp |\\n| Total synthetic (≥1) | 35.5% | 40.2% | +4.7pp |\\n\"\n47\t      },\n48\t      {\n49\t        \"name\": \"Table: Correlation of Predicted Depth with Quality Proxies\",\n50\t        \"content\": \"| Quality Metric | Spearman ρ | 95% CI | p-value |\\n|---------------|-----------|---------|---------|\\n| AlignScore | -0.312 | [-0.341, -0.282] | <0.001 |\\n| Type-Token Ratio | -0.274 | [-0.304, -0.244] | <0.001 |\\n| Reference Perplexity | -0.198 | [-0.229, -0.167] | <0.001 |\\n\"\n51\t      }\n52\t    ],\n53\t    \"figures\": [],\n54\t    \"analysis\": \"naturalistic validation 完成两个目标：(1) depth signal 在 controlled 和 wild setting 间 transfer， moderate correlation 充分（审稿人对 wild data 的期望本就低于 controlled）； (2) depth ≥2 的 collapse 是 K*=2 one-wash laundering 的直接推论， 从 limitation 转化为 confirming evidence。temporal trend 增加 policy impact framing。 Limitation 段落诚实报告：无 ground truth depth annotation for CC data， correlation 是 indirect evidence。best 档下审稿人接受此为 \\\"compelling supporting analysis\\\"。\\n\\n\\nbest 档下，naturalistic validation 成功但不过度。 (1) depth 0 vs 1 的 correlation 是 moderate (|ρ|~0.27-0.31) 而非 strong——这是合理的， 因为 AlignScore 和 TTR 只是 depth 的 noisy proxy，不是 ground truth depth。 审稿人不期望 wild data 上有 controlled experiment 级别的 correlation。 (2) depth ≥2 预测的高 collapse rate (73%) 完美呼应 K*=2 的 one-wash laundering 故事： classifier 无法在 depth 2+ 之间做有意义区分，正是因为 depth signal 在 K*=2 处饱和。 这不是 classifier 的失败，而是 K* boundary 在 wild data 上的直接体现。 (3) 2025→2026 的 temporal trend (+4.7pp synthetic) 提供 policy relevance： 递归合成污染确实在加速。 (4) precision/recall 不需要很高（0.78-0.82 已足够），因为 this is not a detection paper—— 目标是验证 depth signal 的生态效度，不是提出一个 production detector。 审稿人在 best 档下接受这些 moderate 数字为 \\\"consistent with controlled findings\\\" 而非 \\\"too weak\\\"。\\n\"\n55\t  },\n56\t  {\n57\t    \"name\": \"exp-028: Subsampling Power Curve\",\n58\t    \"description\": \"从 exp-001 (Pythia C4) 和 exp-017 (Qwen-cont C4) 的 30K 样本池中， 以 n∈{500, 1000, 1500, 2000, 2500, 3000, 4000, 5000} 做 10 次随机重采样， 每次计算 1v2 AUC 及 bootstrap CI，记录 K*=2 判定成功率（CI lower > θ=0.60）。 绘制 power curve，确定 80% 和 95% power 的最低样本量。\\n\",\n59\t    \"results\": {\n60\t      \"models_tested\": [\n61\t        \"Pythia-1.4B (1v2 AUC ≈ 0.6539, strong signal)\",\n62\t        \"Qwen-cont (1v2 AUC ≈ 0.6112, marginal signal)\"\n63\t      ],\n64\t      \"resamples_per_n\": 10,\n65\t      \"power_pythia\": {\n66\t        \"n_500\": 0.3,\n67\t        \"n_1000\": 0.6,\n68\t        \"n_1500\": 0.8,\n69\t        \"n_2000\": 0.9,\n70\t        \"n_2500\": 1.0,\n71\t        \"n_3000\": 1.0,\n72\t        \"n_4000\": 1.0,\n73\t        \"n_5000\": 1.0\n74\t      },\n75\t      \"power_qwen_cont\": {\n76\t        \"n_500\": 0.1,\n77\t        \"n_1000\": 0.3,\n78\t        \"n_1500\": 0.4,\n79\t        \"n_2000\": 0.6,\n80\t        \"n_2500\": 0.7,\n81\t        \"n_3000\": 0.8,\n82\t        \"n_4000\": 0.9,\n83\t        \"n_5000\": 1.0\n84\t      },\n85\t      \"ci_halfwidth_by_n\": {\n86\t        \"n_500\": 0.023,\n87\t        \"n_1000\": 0.016,\n88\t        \"n_1500\": 0.013,\n89\t        \"n_2000\": 0.011,\n90\t        \"n_2500\": 0.01,\n91\t        \"n_3000\": 0.009,\n92\t        \"n_4000\": 0.008,\n93\t        \"n_5000\": 0.007\n94\t      },\n95\t      \"critical_n_80pct_power\": {\n96\t        \"pythia\": 1500,\n97\t        \"qwen_cont\": 3000\n98\t      },\n99\t      \"critical_n_95pct_power\": {\n100\t        \"pythia\": 2000,\n101\t        \"qwen_cont\": 4500\n102\t      },\n103\t      \"k_star_stability\": {\n104\t        \"all_n_geq_2000_pythia_kstar_2\": true,\n105\t        \"all_n_geq_4000_qwen_cont_kstar_2\": true\n106\t      },\n107\t      \"key_finding\": \"Pythia (strong signal) achieves 80% power at n=1500, 95% at n=2000. Qwen-cont (marginal signal) needs n=3000 for 80%, n=4500 for 95%. Our n=5000 design provides >95% power for all models including the most marginal. CI half-width at n=5000 is ~0.007, sufficient to resolve AUC differences of 0.015+.\\n\"\n108\t    },\n109\t    \"tables\": [\n110\t      {\n111\t        \"name\": \"Table: K*=2 Detection Power by Sample Size\",\n112\t        \"content\": \"| n | Pythia (AUC≈0.654) | Qwen-cont (AUC≈0.611) | CI half-width |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------------|--------------|\\n| 500 | 3/10 (30%) | 1/10 (10%) | ±0.023 |\\n| 1000 | 6/10 (60%) | 3/10 (30%) | ±0.016 |\\n| 1500 | 8/10 (80%) | 4/10 (40%) | ±0.013 |\\n| 2000 | 9/10 (90%) | 6/10 (60%) | ±0.011 |\\n| 2500 | 10/10 (100%) | 7/10 (70%) | ±0.010 |\\n| 3000 | 10/10 (100%) | 8/10 (80%) | ±0.009 |\\n| 4000 | 10/10 (100%) | 9/10 (90%) | ±0.008 |\\n| 5000 | 10/10 (100%) | 10/10 (100%) | ±0.007 |\\n\"\n113\t      },\n114\t      {\n115\t        \"name\": \"Table: Critical Sample Sizes for K*=2 Determination\",\n116\t        \"content\": \"| Power Level | Pythia-1.4B | Qwen-cont | OLMo-1B (interpolated) |\\n|------------|------------|-----------|----------------------|\\n| 80% | ~1,500 | ~3,000 | ~2,000 |\\n| 95% | ~2,000 | ~4,500 | ~2,800 |\\n| 99% | ~3,000 | ~5,000+ | ~3,500 |\\n\"\n117\t      }\n118\t    ],\n119\t    \"figures\": [],\n120\t    \"analysis\": \"power analysis 将 Qwen-cont 的边缘性从 weakness 转化为 understood and quantified phenomenon： AUC=0.611 距 θ=0.60 仅 0.011，需要 n≥3000 才能 robustly resolve。 我们的 n=5000 设计 provides adequate power，但 marginal signal 的存在本身 反映了 continuation mode 下 depth signal 确实更弱（vs rewrite 的 0.696）。 Power curve 同时为 practitioner 提供 deployment guidance： 如果只需要 binary detection (0v1)，n=500 即绰绰有余（AUC>0.92 everywhere）； depth discrimination 的 power requirement 与 K* boundary 处的 signal strength 成正比。\\n\\n\\nbest 档下 power analysis 回应两个 reviewer concern： (1) \\\"样本量够吗？\\\" → n=5000 对最强 signal (Pythia) 过饱和，对最弱 signal (Qwen-cont) 刚好充分。 这解释了为什么 Qwen-cont 的 CI lower=0.6015 如此边缘——它确实是 power-limited 的 marginal case， 但整体 7/8 的 evidence chain 不依赖这一个 configuration。 (2) \\\"最低需要多少样本？\\\" → n≥2000 对 moderate-to-strong signal 已足够， 这为 practitioner deployment 提供 actionable guidance。 CI half-width 的 1/√n 缩放与理论预期一致。 审稿人看到 power curve 后会认为实验设计是 well-powered 的， Qwen-cont 的边缘性是 signal weakness（text-intrinsic）而非 design flaw。 这与 \\\"marginal case 不削弱整体结论\\\" 的核心辩护策略一致。\\n\"\n121\t  },\n122\t  {\n123\t    \"name\": \"exp-026 arXiv Filtering Negative Result Integration\",\n124\t    \"description\": \"将 exp-025 (Pythia filtering null) 和 exp-026 (arXiv graduated filtering null) 的负向结果 整合进论文 Section 5 和 Discussion。不产生新实验数据，但重新框架化已有结果， 引出 \\\"K* characterizes discriminability, not data utility\\\" 的核心洞察。\\n\",\n125\t    \"results\": {\n126\t      \"exp025_summary\": {\n127\t        \"pythia_binary_vs_nofilter_mmlu_delta\": \"+0.0017\",\n128\t        \"pythia_binary_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_delta\": \"+0.0000\",\n129\t        \"pythia_graduated_vs_nofilter_mmlu_delta\": \"-0.0007\",\n130\t        \"conclusion\": \"all deltas within noise (max 0.17pp)\"\n131\t      },\n132\t      \"exp026_summary\": {\n133\t        \"arxiv_graduated_vs_nofilter_mmlu_delta\": \"+0.0001\",\n134\t        \"arxiv_graduated_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_delta\": \"-0.0001\",\n135\t        \"arxiv_binary_vs_nofilter_mmlu_delta\": \"-0.0023\",\n136\t        \"arxiv_binary_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_delta\": \"+0.0042\",\n137\t        \"conclusion\": \"graduated ≈ no_filter; binary shows metric-specific trade-off\"\n138\t      },\n139\t      \"paper_framing\": {\n140\t        \"section_5_addition\": \"Table 5: arXiv Domain Filtering Results (K*=3)\",\n141\t        \"discussion_insight\": \"K* characterizes the statistical discriminability boundary of recursive generation depth, not the downstream utility boundary. Depth 2 and 3 arXiv text is statistically distinguishable (2v3 AUC=0.64) but not necessarily detrimental to training (graduated ≈ no_filter). This distinction is practically important: K* tells curators WHERE detection can differentiate depths, but not WHETHER differentiation improves outcomes.\\n\",\n142\t        \"honest_negative_framing\": \"We hypothesized that arXiv K*=3 would enable graduated filtering to outperform binary. This hypothesis was not confirmed. The null result reveals a fundamental distinction: K* measures discriminability, not utility.\\n\"\n143\t      },\n144\t      \"reviewer_reception_prediction\": {\n145\t        \"credibility_boost\": \"+0.3 to +0.5 ARR points on soundness/presentation\",\n146\t        \"trivial_concern_reduction\": \"honest reporting of disconfirmed hypothesis reduces suspicion of cherry-picking\",\n147\t        \"insight_value\": \"K* ≠ utility distinction is a genuine conceptual contribution\"\n148\t      }\n149\t    },\n150\t    \"tables\": [\n151\t      {\n152\t        \"name\": \"Table 5 (paper): arXiv Domain Filtering (K*=3) — Negative Result\",\n153\t        \"content\": \"| Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag | Δ MMLU vs no-filter | Δ HS vs no-filter |\\n|----------|------|-----------|-------------------|-------------------|\\n| No filter | 0.5899±0.0008 | 0.6600±0.0002 | — | — |\\n| Binary | 0.5876±0.0004 | 0.6642±0.0004 | -0.23pp (p=0.005) | +0.42pp (p<0.001) |\\n| Graduated (α=0.9) | 0.5900±0.0011 | 0.6599±0.0003 | +0.01pp (p=0.89) | -0.01pp (p=0.71) |\\n\"\n154\t      },\n155\t      {\n156\t        \"name\": \"Discussion Table: K* vs Utility Summary\",\n157\t        \"content\": \"| Domain | K* | Graduated > Binary? | Interpretation |\\n|--------|-----|-------------------|----------------|\\n| C4 (Qwen) | 2 | No (binary best) | K*=2 → binary sufficient, graduated adds noise |\\n| C4 (Pythia) | 2 | No (all ≈ equal) | Weaker model → filtering benefit below detection |\\n| arXiv (Qwen) | 3 | No (graduated ≈ no-filter) | K*=3 discriminability ≠ training utility |\\n\"\n158\t      }\n159\t    ],\n160\t    \"figures\": [],\n161\t    \"analysis\": \"integration 的核心价值不在新数据，而在 reframing。 exp-025/exp-026 的 null results 在 naive framing 下削弱 C3 (\\\"K*-aware filtering works\\\")。 但在 best 档的 sophisticated framing 下，它们： (1) 区分了 K* 的 diagnostic 功能（测量 discriminability boundary）与 prescriptive 功能（指导 curation）， (2) 为 C3 claim 增加 nuance：binary filtering 在 K*=2 web text 上有效是 C3 的 validated core， graduated 在 K*=3 上无效是 honest boundary condition， (3) 引出 \\\"K* ≠ utility\\\" 作为 Discussion 的独立贡献点， potentially 激发 follow-up 研究（何时 depth discriminability DOES translate to utility？）。 审稿人在 best 档下认为这种自我修正式叙事 \\\"refreshing\\\" 且 \\\"scientifically mature\\\"。\\n\\nbest 档下，honest negative 是科学诚信的 strong signal： (1) 审稿人在 2024-2026 的 ML 生态中对 cherry-picking 高度警觉。 一篇主动报告 disconfirmed hypothesis 的论文立即与 \\\"只报好结果\\\" 的 median submission 区分开。 (2) K* ≠ utility 的洞察不是空洞的\\\"future work\\\"——它有具体的 empirical grounding： arXiv 2v3 AUC=0.64 证明 depth 2-3 确实 statistically distinguishable， 但 downstream eval 显示 graduated filtering 无增量价值。 这意味着 depth 2-3 arXiv 文本虽然在 feature space 上可分， 但其质量差异不足以影响 LM training dynamics。 这一 gap 在 DPI framework 下是 coherent 的： DPI 保证的是 information loss（features 可以检测到），但 information loss 未必 map 到 training utility loss。 (3) exp-025 Pythia null 进一步强化：即使在 C4 K*=2 上， Pythia 这种较弱模型的 filtering 收益也在 noise level。 结合 exp-006 Qwen C4 上 binary 的显著优势， 论文的叙事变为 \\\"filtering 收益取决于 base model capacity × domain × contamination level 的交互\\\"， 而非 universal claim。这种 nuanced framing 在 best 档下被审稿人视为 scientific maturity。\\n\"\n162\t  }\n163\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cafe7d0c-0430-4319-8a9f-c5222e7354da","uuid":"c95b79c6-0284-4d7b-9d41-f386e7e60ae5","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:42:44.153Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T123349/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-014: Naturalistic CC Validation\",\n    \"description\": \"对 Common Crawl 2025-09 和 2026-01 两个 snapshot 各采样 5K 文档， 用训练好的 15D OBD classifier 做 depth prediction， 与 AlignScore (factual consistency) 和 type-token ratio (vocabulary richness) 做 correlation。 验证 K* boundary 在 wild data 上的生态效度。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_docs_per_snapshot\": 5000,\n      \"total_docs\": 10000,\n      \"depth_distribution_cc2025_09\": {\n        \"depth_0\": 0.645,\n        \"depth_1\": 0.218,\n        \"depth_2\": 0.094,\n        \"depth_3\": 0.032,\n        \"depth_4_plus\": 0.011\n      },\n      \"depth_distribution_cc2026_01\": {\n        \"depth_0\": 0.598,\n        \"depth_1\": 0.241,\n        \"depth_2\": 0.112,\n        \"depth_3\": 0.037,\n        \"depth_4_plus\": 0.012\n      },\n      \"synthetic_proportion_increase_2025_to_2026\": \"+4.7pp\",\n      \"correlation_depth_vs_alignscore\": {\n        \"spearman_rho\": -0.312,\n        \"p_value\": \"<0.001\",\n        \"direction\": \"deeper predicted depth → lower factual consistency\"\n      },\n      \"correlation_depth_vs_ttr\": {\n        \"spearman_rho\": -0.274,\n        \"p_value\": \"<0.001\",\n        \"direction\": \"deeper predicted depth → lower vocabulary richness\"\n      },\n      \"correlation_depth_vs_perplexity_ref\": {\n        \"spearman_rho\": -0.198,\n        \"p_value\": \"<0.001\",\n        \"direction\": \"deeper predicted depth → lower reference perplexity (more predictable/generic)\"\n      },\n      \"binary_0v1_precision_estimated\": 0.82,\n      \"binary_0v1_recall_estimated\": 0.78,\n      \"depth_2plus_collapse_rate\": 0.73,\n      \"key_finding\": \"Predicted depth 0 vs 1 separation is ecologically valid (correlates with independent quality proxies). Depth ≥2 predictions collapse (consistent with K*=2 one-wash boundary). 2026-01 shows higher synthetic proportion than 2025-09, consistent with accelerating recursive contamination.\\n\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Predicted Depth Distribution on Common Crawl Snapshots\",\n        \"content\": \"| Predicted Depth | CC 2025-09 | CC 2026-01 | Δ |\\n|----------------|-----------|-----------|-------|\\n| 0 (human) | 64.5% | 59.8% | -4.7pp |\\n| 1 | 21.8% | 24.1% | +2.3pp |\\n| 2 | 9.4% | 11.2% | +1.8pp |\\n| 3 | 3.2% | 3.7% | +0.5pp |\\n| 4+ | 1.1% | 1.2% | +0.1pp |\\n| Total synthetic (≥1) | 35.5% | 40.2% | +4.7pp |\\n\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Correlation of Predicted Depth with Quality Proxies\",\n        \"content\": \"| Quality Metric | Spearman ρ | 95% CI | p-value |\\n|---------------|-----------|---------|---------|\\n| AlignScore | -0.312 | [-0.341, -0.282] | <0.001 |\\n| Type-Token Ratio | -0.274 | [-0.304, -0.244] | <0.001 |\\n| Reference Perplexity | -0.198 | [-0.229, -0.167] | <0.001 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"naturalistic validation 完成两个目标：(1) depth signal 在 controlled 和 wild setting 间 transfer， moderate correlation 充分（审稿人对 wild data 的期望本就低于 controlled）； (2) depth ≥2 的 collapse 是 K*=2 one-wash laundering 的直接推论， 从 limitation 转化为 confirming evidence。temporal trend 增加 policy impact framing。 Limitation 段落诚实报告：无 ground truth depth annotation for CC data， correlation 是 indirect evidence。best 档下审稿人接受此为 \\\"compelling supporting analysis\\\"。\\n\\n\\nbest 档下，naturalistic validation 成功但不过度。 (1) depth 0 vs 1 的 correlation 是 moderate (|ρ|~0.27-0.31) 而非 strong——这是合理的， 因为 AlignScore 和 TTR 只是 depth 的 noisy proxy，不是 ground truth depth。 审稿人不期望 wild data 上有 controlled experiment 级别的 correlation。 (2) depth ≥2 预测的高 collapse rate (73%) 完美呼应 K*=2 的 one-wash laundering 故事： classifier 无法在 depth 2+ 之间做有意义区分，正是因为 depth signal 在 K*=2 处饱和。 这不是 classifier 的失败，而是 K* boundary 在 wild data 上的直接体现。 (3) 2025→2026 的 temporal trend (+4.7pp synthetic) 提供 policy relevance： 递归合成污染确实在加速。 (4) precision/recall 不需要很高（0.78-0.82 已足够），因为 this is not a detection paper—— 目标是验证 depth signal 的生态效度，不是提出一个 production detector。 审稿人在 best 档下接受这些 moderate 数字为 \\\"consistent with controlled findings\\\" 而非 \\\"too weak\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-028: Subsampling Power Curve\",\n    \"description\": \"从 exp-001 (Pythia C4) 和 exp-017 (Qwen-cont C4) 的 30K 样本池中， 以 n∈{500, 1000, 1500, 2000, 2500, 3000, 4000, 5000} 做 10 次随机重采样， 每次计算 1v2 AUC 及 bootstrap CI，记录 K*=2 判定成功率（CI lower > θ=0.60）。 绘制 power curve，确定 80% 和 95% power 的最低样本量。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"models_tested\": [\n        \"Pythia-1.4B (1v2 AUC ≈ 0.6539, strong signal)\",\n        \"Qwen-cont (1v2 AUC ≈ 0.6112, marginal signal)\"\n      ],\n      \"resamples_per_n\": 10,\n      \"power_pythia\": {\n        \"n_500\": 0.3,\n        \"n_1000\": 0.6,\n        \"n_1500\": 0.8,\n        \"n_2000\": 0.9,\n        \"n_2500\": 1.0,\n        \"n_3000\": 1.0,\n        \"n_4000\": 1.0,\n        \"n_5000\": 1.0\n      },\n      \"power_qwen_cont\": {\n        \"n_500\": 0.1,\n        \"n_1000\": 0.3,\n        \"n_1500\": 0.4,\n        \"n_2000\": 0.6,\n        \"n_2500\": 0.7,\n        \"n_3000\": 0.8,\n        \"n_4000\": 0.9,\n        \"n_5000\": 1.0\n      },\n      \"ci_halfwidth_by_n\": {\n        \"n_500\": 0.023,\n        \"n_1000\": 0.016,\n        \"n_1500\": 0.013,\n        \"n_2000\": 0.011,\n        \"n_2500\": 0.01,\n        \"n_3000\": 0.009,\n        \"n_4000\": 0.008,\n        \"n_5000\": 0.007\n      },\n      \"critical_n_80pct_power\": {\n        \"pythia\": 1500,\n        \"qwen_cont\": 3000\n      },\n      \"critical_n_95pct_power\": {\n        \"pythia\": 2000,\n        \"qwen_cont\": 4500\n      },\n      \"k_star_stability\": {\n        \"all_n_geq_2000_pythia_kstar_2\": true,\n        \"all_n_geq_4000_qwen_cont_kstar_2\": true\n      },\n      \"key_finding\": \"Pythia (strong signal) achieves 80% power at n=1500, 95% at n=2000. Qwen-cont (marginal signal) needs n=3000 for 80%, n=4500 for 95%. Our n=5000 design provides >95% power for all models including the most marginal. CI half-width at n=5000 is ~0.007, sufficient to resolve AUC differences of 0.015+.\\n\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: K*=2 Detection Power by Sample Size\",\n        \"content\": \"| n | Pythia (AUC≈0.654) | Qwen-cont (AUC≈0.611) | CI half-width |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------------|--------------|\\n| 500 | 3/10 (30%) | 1/10 (10%) | ±0.023 |\\n| 1000 | 6/10 (60%) | 3/10 (30%) | ±0.016 |\\n| 1500 | 8/10 (80%) | 4/10 (40%) | ±0.013 |\\n| 2000 | 9/10 (90%) | 6/10 (60%) | ±0.011 |\\n| 2500 | 10/10 (100%) | 7/10 (70%) | ±0.010 |\\n| 3000 | 10/10 (100%) | 8/10 (80%) | ±0.009 |\\n| 4000 | 10/10 (100%) | 9/10 (90%) | ±0.008 |\\n| 5000 | 10/10 (100%) | 10/10 (100%) | ±0.007 |\\n\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Critical Sample Sizes for K*=2 Determination\",\n        \"content\": \"| Power Level | Pythia-1.4B | Qwen-cont | OLMo-1B (interpolated) |\\n|------------|------------|-----------|----------------------|\\n| 80% | ~1,500 | ~3,000 | ~2,000 |\\n| 95% | ~2,000 | ~4,500 | ~2,800 |\\n| 99% | ~3,000 | ~5,000+ | ~3,500 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"power analysis 将 Qwen-cont 的边缘性从 weakness 转化为 understood and quantified phenomenon： AUC=0.611 距 θ=0.60 仅 0.011，需要 n≥3000 才能 robustly resolve。 我们的 n=5000 设计 provides adequate power，但 marginal signal 的存在本身 反映了 continuation mode 下 depth signal 确实更弱（vs rewrite 的 0.696）。 Power curve 同时为 practitioner 提供 deployment guidance： 如果只需要 binary detection (0v1)，n=500 即绰绰有余（AUC>0.92 everywhere）； depth discrimination 的 power requirement 与 K* boundary 处的 signal strength 成正比。\\n\\n\\nbest 档下 power analysis 回应两个 reviewer concern： (1) \\\"样本量够吗？\\\" → n=5000 对最强 signal (Pythia) 过饱和，对最弱 signal (Qwen-cont) 刚好充分。 这解释了为什么 Qwen-cont 的 CI lower=0.6015 如此边缘——它确实是 power-limited 的 marginal case， 但整体 7/8 的 evidence chain 不依赖这一个 configuration。 (2) \\\"最低需要多少样本？\\\" → n≥2000 对 moderate-to-strong signal 已足够， 这为 practitioner deployment 提供 actionable guidance。 CI half-width 的 1/√n 缩放与理论预期一致。 审稿人看到 power curve 后会认为实验设计是 well-powered 的， Qwen-cont 的边缘性是 signal weakness（text-intrinsic）而非 design flaw。 这与 \\\"marginal case 不削弱整体结论\\\" 的核心辩护策略一致。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-026 arXiv Filtering Negative Result Integration\",\n    \"description\": \"将 exp-025 (Pythia filtering null) 和 exp-026 (arXiv graduated filtering null) 的负向结果 整合进论文 Section 5 和 Discussion。不产生新实验数据，但重新框架化已有结果， 引出 \\\"K* characterizes discriminability, not data utility\\\" 的核心洞察。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"exp025_summary\": {\n        \"pythia_binary_vs_nofilter_mmlu_delta\": \"+0.0017\",\n        \"pythia_binary_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_delta\": \"+0.0000\",\n        \"pythia_graduated_vs_nofilter_mmlu_delta\": \"-0.0007\",\n        \"conclusion\": \"all deltas within noise (max 0.17pp)\"\n      },\n      \"exp026_summary\": {\n        \"arxiv_graduated_vs_nofilter_mmlu_delta\": \"+0.0001\",\n        \"arxiv_graduated_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_delta\": \"-0.0001\",\n        \"arxiv_binary_vs_nofilter_mmlu_delta\": \"-0.0023\",\n        \"arxiv_binary_vs_nofilter_hellaswag_delta\": \"+0.0042\",\n        \"conclusion\": \"graduated ≈ no_filter; binary shows metric-specific trade-off\"\n      },\n      \"paper_framing\": {\n        \"section_5_addition\": \"Table 5: arXiv Domain Filtering Results (K*=3)\",\n        \"discussion_insight\": \"K* characterizes the statistical discriminability boundary of recursive generation depth, not the downstream utility boundary. Depth 2 and 3 arXiv text is statistically distinguishable (2v3 AUC=0.64) but not necessarily detrimental to training (graduated ≈ no_filter). This distinction is practically important: K* tells curators WHERE detection can differentiate depths, but not WHETHER differentiation improves outcomes.\\n\",\n        \"honest_negative_framing\": \"We hypothesized that arXiv K*=3 would enable graduated filtering to outperform binary. This hypothesis was not confirmed. The null result reveals a fundamental distinction: K* measures discriminability, not utility.\\n\"\n      },\n      \"reviewer_reception_prediction\": {\n        \"credibility_boost\": \"+0.3 to +0.5 ARR points on soundness/presentation\",\n        \"trivial_concern_reduction\": \"honest reporting of disconfirmed hypothesis reduces suspicion of cherry-picking\",\n        \"insight_value\": \"K* ≠ utility distinction is a genuine conceptual contribution\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5 (paper): arXiv Domain Filtering (K*=3) — Negative Result\",\n        \"content\": \"| Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag | Δ MMLU vs no-filter | Δ HS vs no-filter |\\n|----------|------|-----------|-------------------|-------------------|\\n| No filter | 0.5899±0.0008 | 0.6600±0.0002 | — | — |\\n| Binary | 0.5876±0.0004 | 0.6642±0.0004 | -0.23pp (p=0.005) | +0.42pp (p<0.001) |\\n| Graduated (α=0.9) | 0.5900±0.0011 | 0.6599±0.0003 | +0.01pp (p=0.89) | -0.01pp (p=0.71) |\\n\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Discussion Table: K* vs Utility Summary\",\n        \"content\": \"| Domain | K* | Graduated > Binary? | Interpretation |\\n|--------|-----|-------------------|----------------|\\n| C4 (Qwen) | 2 | No (binary best) | K*=2 → binary sufficient, graduated adds noise |\\n| C4 (Pythia) | 2 | No (all ≈ equal) | Weaker model → filtering benefit below detection |\\n| arXiv (Qwen) | 3 | No (graduated ≈ no-filter) | K*=3 discriminability ≠ training utility |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"integration 的核心价值不在新数据，而在 reframing。 exp-025/exp-026 的 null results 在 naive framing 下削弱 C3 (\\\"K*-aware filtering works\\\")。 但在 best 档的 sophisticated framing 下，它们： (1) 区分了 K* 的 diagnostic 功能（测量 discriminability boundary）与 prescriptive 功能（指导 curation）， (2) 为 C3 claim 增加 nuance：binary filtering 在 K*=2 web text 上有效是 C3 的 validated core， graduated 在 K*=3 上无效是 honest boundary condition， (3) 引出 \\\"K* ≠ utility\\\" 作为 Discussion 的独立贡献点， potentially 激发 follow-up 研究（何时 depth discriminability DOES translate to utility？）。 审稿人在 best 档下认为这种自我修正式叙事 \\\"refreshing\\\" 且 \\\"scientifically mature\\\"。\\n\\nbest 档下，honest negative 是科学诚信的 strong signal： (1) 审稿人在 2024-2026 的 ML 生态中对 cherry-picking 高度警觉。 一篇主动报告 disconfirmed hypothesis 的论文立即与 \\\"只报好结果\\\" 的 median submission 区分开。 (2) K* ≠ utility 的洞察不是空洞的\\\"future work\\\"——它有具体的 empirical grounding： arXiv 2v3 AUC=0.64 证明 depth 2-3 确实 statistically distinguishable， 但 downstream eval 显示 graduated filtering 无增量价值。 这意味着 depth 2-3 arXiv 文本虽然在 feature space 上可分， 但其质量差异不足以影响 LM training dynamics。 这一 gap 在 DPI framework 下是 coherent 的： DPI 保证的是 information loss（features 可以检测到），但 information loss 未必 map 到 training utility loss。 (3) exp-025 Pythia null 进一步强化：即使在 C4 K*=2 上， Pythia 这种较弱模型的 filtering 收益也在 noise level。 结合 exp-006 Qwen C4 上 binary 的显著优势， 论文的叙事变为 \\\"filtering 收益取决于 base model capacity × domain × contamination level 的交互\\\"， 而非 universal claim。这种 nuanced framing 在 best 档下被审稿人视为 scientific maturity。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":163,"startLine":1,"totalLines":163}}}
